@startuml SearchDocument
title Search Document - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "UI Layer" as UI
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "IndexService" as Index
participant "StorageEngine" as Storage
participant "RankingEngine" as Rank

User -> UI : Enter search query
UI -> Search : search(query, filters)
Search -> Index : queryIndex(query)
Index --> Search : results
Search -> Rank : rank(results, relevance)
Rank --> Search : rankedResults
Search -> Storage : fetchDocuments(rankedResults)
Storage --> Search : documents
Search --> UI : searchResults
UI --> User : Display results

@enduml
